      "writtenOn": "2024-06-25T12:46:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Zephyr uses the [tm structure](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/zephyr/main/lib/libc/minimal/include/time.h;l\u003d24), which is mapped 1:1 with [rtc_time](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/zephyr/main/include/zephyr/drivers/rtc.h;l\u003d55). There is function [timeutil_timegm](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/zephyr/main/include/zephyr/sys/timeutil.h;l\u003d62) which is tested by zephyr [unit test](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/zephyr/main/tests/unit/timeutil/). Unfortunately, these ones [can not](https://docs.zephyrproject.org/latest/develop/test/ztest.html#quick-start-unit-testing) be run on hardware. I added the test name.",
      "parentUuid": "75007d06_15b7e8d9",
